CORE gcc-only
float.c

^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
^file float.c line \d+ function main: operator 'shr' not defined for vectors of type 'float'$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
^warning: ignoring
Invariant check failed
--
As with GCC and Clang, shifts of vectors with floating-point elements are
rejected, as the back-ends do not support them.
